1. Origin of the code
---------------------

The Rust implementation in this repository was **imported** on 2026-04-02 from
the repository https://github.com/MatiasHiltunen/ssh3 — a fork of
https://github.com/francoismichel/ssh3 — as a workspace of seven crates:

    ssh3-proto   ssh3-core   ssh3-quinn   ssh3-h3
    ssh3-auth    ssh3-client ssh3-server

The import consists of 13 commits authored by Matias Hiltunen
(26164588+MatiasHiltunen@users.noreply.github.com) and covers the protocol
core, the authentication layer, the client and server runtimes, PTY handling,
port and agent forwarding, OIDC support and the Rust<->Go interop test
harness.

The code was subsequently extended by the maintainers of
https://github.com/nagual2/ssh3-go, notably with the Rust-side remediation of
the pass-6 audit findings F-19 and F-21.

This repository was extracted from https://github.com/nagual2/ssh3-go on
2026-10-21 as a standalone project. The Go implementation remains the only
shipped product; see README.md for the positioning of this workspace.

The code was **not** written from scratch, and this repository is not a fork of
the upstream projects — it is an independent reference implementation that
imported their Rust code under the same license.


