3. Vendored third-party code
----------------------------

vendor/h3 — a copy of the crates.io crate `h3` version 0.0.8
(https://github.com/hyperium/h3), Copyright (c) 2020 h3 authors, distributed
under the MIT License. The copy carries a deliberate patch that adds the
`:protocol` pseudo-header support required by Extended CONNECT; the upstream
license text is kept in vendor/h3/LICENSE. Do not replace this directory with
the upstream crate without checking the SSH3 requirements.

All other dependencies are regular crates.io registry dependencies listed in
Cargo.lock and are not vendored into this repository.
